category: Video
requires: girepository-GLib2.0 libaravis0.8_0 libglib2.0-devel
sdesc: "Library for video acquisition using Genicam cameras (GObject Introspection data)"
ldesc: "Aravis is a glib/gobject based library for video acquisition using Genicam
cameras. It currently only implements an ethernet camera protocol used for
industrial cameras."
external-source: aravis

